# UNDERDELVE: Mo's jump is one fixed arc that only carries his walking speed.
# The 64 rooms were first built around a longer jump; this walks and jumps
# every room from every way in (all gates open) and checks that no spot that
# jump reached is out of reach now. It also checks the map's edges line up.
game underdelve
wait 5
expect reach_lost == 0
expect map_errors == 0
